Subject: [PATCH 07810/11362] [outer-loop] ARC lever #1: object-structured
 perception into inducer prompt + FIX race-broken induce_prompt
 (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5830)

A conductor commit-race had swept in ONLY the induce_prompt injection line
(061465cdc) without the two functions it calls -> induce_prompt NameError'd on
EVERY call (live inducer broken). This re-adds _object_perception_on() +
objects_block() so the default path works again AND completes lever #1: behind
CARNOT_ARC_OBJECT_PERCEPTION (default off), induce_prompt appends a
connected-component object table (translation-invariant object_hash for
cross-frame identity, containment, adjacency) alongside the raw grid, attacking
GAP-ARCH-FEATURES (order-1 position-only features can't track a moved object).
Verified: OFF byte-identical (no OBJECT STRUCTURE), ON adds the table, objects_block
defensive (returns '' on any failure, caps at 60 objects). ruff clean.
Offline heldout-accuracy A/B on the induction diagnostic corpus is the separate
GPU measurement step.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
